flowchart LR
  POS[POS signup] --> LOCAL[23 local POS databases]
  APP[Loyalty app] --> LDB[Loyalty database]
  WEB[Checkout] --> PG[Shop platform]
  PAY[Mobile money link] --> LOCAL

  LOCAL --> USE[Service and reporting]
  LDB --> USE
  PG --> USE

  USE --> SHARE[Shared data with partners]
  SHARE --> ARCHIVE[Restricted archive]
  ARCHIVE --> DELETE[Verified deletion]

  LOCAL -. no common ID .-> E1[Duplicate records]
  USE -. weak access .-> E2[Data leak risk]
  USE -. poor purpose controls .-> E3[Manual joins]
  SHARE -. vendor controls unclear .-> E4[Cross border concern]
  ARCHIVE -. missing retention .-> E5[Deletion gap]
